    "play-rainbow.online": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n <head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n  <link href=\"/vite.svg\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/>\n  <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n  <title>\n   Quantum Drift\n  </title>\n  <script>\n   window.pageData={\"title\":\"Quantum Drift\",\"name\":\"Quantum Drift\",\"description\":\"In the vibrant, futuristic universe of Quantum Drift, players navigate through mind-bending dimensions filled with challenging puzzles and breathtaking visuals. Use your ability to manipulate time and space to drift through levels, solving intricate challenges while outsmarting foes. As you progress, unlock powerful upgrades and unique abilities that enhance your gameplay and transform your strategies. Experience the thrill of mastering reality itself in this captivating adventure that promises endless excitement\\u2014are you ready to drift into the unknown?\",\"features\":[{\"title\":\"Time Manipulation Mechanics\",\"description\":\"Players can manipulate time to solve puzzles and overcome obstacles, allowing them to slow down or rewind events in the environment, adding depth to gameplay strategies.\"},{\"title\":\"Dimensional Drift Navigation\",\"description\":\"Navigate through shifting dimensions that alter gameplay mechanics and player perspective, challenging players to adapt their strategies as they explore intricate level designs.\"},{\"title\":\"Unlockable Abilities System\",\"description\":\"As players progress, they can unlock unique abilities that enhance their time and space manipulation skills, encouraging diverse playstyles and tactical approaches to challenges.\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"name\":\"Liam H.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The visuals in Quantum Drift are absolutely stunning! Each dimension feels so unique, and it really pulls you into the game.\"},{\"name\":\"Sophie T.\",\"rating\":4.5,\"review\":\"I love how challenging the puzzles are! It keeps you on your toes, but sometimes it feels like they could use a tiny bit more guidance.\"},{\"name\":\"Jake P.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Haha, wow, I didn't realize the Time Warp ability could actually slow down enemies like that! It makes the gameplay super fun and strategic.\"}],\"cta\":{\"headline\":\"Master Time and Space!\",\"subtext\":\"Dive into Quantum Drift today and conquer mind-bending challenges before it's too late!\"},\"image\":\"/lnaso1-images/75/58/6f/75586f7ef4d3de8c2e544fc0433171ef.webp\"}\n  </script>\n  <script crossorigin=\"\" src=\"/assets/index-nCJS29Kf.js\" type=\"module\">\n  </script>\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/style-xWaq6zb0.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n </head>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"root\">\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>\n",
